# Store and check out every text file with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone checks files out as CRLF, and anything that
# checks formatting (Biome, Ruff, Prettier) disagrees with CI, which runs on
# Linux. Pinning eol=lf keeps the working tree byte-identical everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
